Origin: DHI, pnpm patchedDependencies entry for isolated-vm@5.0.3
Upstream: https://github.com/laverdet/isolated-vm/blob/v5.0.3/src/lib/timer.h
Description: timer.h uses uint32_t without including <cstdint>, which GCC 15 no longer
 provides transitively, so the from-source build fails with "uint32_t has not been
 declared". isolated-vm is compiled from source in this package instead of fetching
 the GitHub release prebuild (npm_config_build_from_source=isolated-vm); this include
 makes that compile succeed. isolated-vm 6 and 7 need Node 24 and are not an option.
Forwarded: not-yet

--- a/src/lib/timer.h
+++ b/src/lib/timer.h
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #pragma once
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <memory>
 #include <functional>
 
